    skos:prefLabel 'in-situ chlorophyll fluorometer (second sensor)'@en ;
    skos:definition 'An instrument that determines the amount of chlorophyll in place in the field by measuring the quantity of red light (around 685nm) emitted by the target water volume following excitation by pulses of blue light (around 460-470nm). Deployed on a package of instruments or sensors as the second sensor of this type.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:S04::S04412'^^xsd:string .
